Uyyy, haven't seen this one for a while...
-> Long time no see Miko...
Let us fix 'er up and get her refueled - story of not getting re-aquainted with the tow truck.

But really, I know the clock is against you, but did you even plan your journey?

We all sometimes use all our POJ for speed, and it's all play 'til radiation toasts your machine.

-> Planning POJ depending on the specific trajectory is the first course in school thank you. Can I go?
Yes.

But one last thing.

-> Yes.
Your machine has some outdated systems. Guess your dad hasn't been able to upgrade it for a while...

We can set 'em up to date, IF you can spare the time.
